<section class="projects-history container" id="osl-experience" aria-labelledby="osl-experience-title">
  <div class="projects-section-heading">
    <h2 id="osl-experience-title">Research software collaborations</h2>
    <p>These contributions predate SciStitch and were made through Open Science Labs.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="projects-history-list">
    <article id="infodengue">
      <h3><a href="https://info.dengue.mat.br/">Infodengue</a></h3>
      <p>Built visualizations and contributed to web and deployment workflows for Brazil’s mosquito-borne disease monitoring initiative, co-founded by <a href="https://ceph.fgv.br/node/91">Flávio Codeço Coelho</a> and other researchers.</p>
    </article>
    <article id="literev">
      <h3><a href="https://literev.unige.ch/">LiteRev</a></h3>
      <p>Provided technical leadership and worked on search, background processing, and benchmarking for literature review software. The University of Geneva founding team includes <a href="https://www.jmir.org/2023/1/e39736/">Erol Orel, Fatma Aziza Merzouki, and Olivia Keiser</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

